{"1964650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eden Universe", "steam_appid": 1964650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A true God Game where faith, miracles, morality, and your Avatar decide the destiny of Eden itself.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A god is not defined by power alone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Guide your followers, shape the world, teach your Avatar, perform miracles, and forge your own legend through the Eight Pillars of Eden Universe.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/55d7b9252d08989b8beec9fd55eb1a3f.avif?t=1780229283\" width=448 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/96cde4d27c42a24eb02e953d56c4e4ee.poster.avif?t=1780229283\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/96cde4d27c42a24eb02e953d56c4e4ee.webm?t=1780229283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/96cde4d27c42a24eb02e953d56c4e4ee.mp4?t=1780229283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Faith is the foundation of the entire world of Eden Universe. Every inhabitant has their own beliefs, hopes, and fears. It is up to you whether you earn their devotion through kindness, miracles, and guidance, or bring them under your rule through fear and divine power. Your followers are not resources. They are living people who decide whom to trust, whom to worship, and for which god they are willing to die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/e186dc8ac077bffe93646c2308b3adc6.avif?t=1780229283\" width=448 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/9a22f52bb1edc7a7cf340cc8e169c8ff.poster.avif?t=1780229283\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/9a22f52bb1edc7a7cf340cc8e169c8ff.webm?t=1780229283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/9a22f52bb1edc7a7cf340cc8e169c8ff.mp4?t=1780229283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your Avatar is far more than an ordinary unit. It is a living being that observes the world, learns from the gods, and develops its own personality. Teach it miracles, guide it along its path, and watch as it gradually becomes a legend known throughout Eden. Every Avatar has its own story. The story it writes is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/cd6697f2e736d729f13551664df13990.avif?t=1780229283\" width=448 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Wield powers capable of changing the fate of entire civilizations. Summon forests upon barren lands, heal your followers, call down fire from the heavens, or unleash catastrophes that forever reshape the world. Miracles are more than spectacular abilities. They are the language through which gods speak to mortals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/194c09d890099f2277d7ee8edd822ae6.avif?t=1780229283\" width=448 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are not the only god in Eden. Powerful deities have fought for influence, followers, and dominion over the world for ages. Each possesses its own ambitions, personality, and vision of the future. Forge alliances, wage holy wars, or stand against those who seek to bend mortals to their will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/74b4ae5e5ca73aec215f4d495bd00839.avif?t=1780229283\" width=448 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Eden does not wait for your commands. Cities grow, people work, armies march, animals roam, and the changing seasons continually reshape the world around you. Every decision leaves its mark, and every event has the potential to begin a story no one could have predicted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/38ea3573ad10fcf89f782cafabcfd96f.avif?t=1780229283\" width=448 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From humble villages to thriving cities full of life. Help your followers build a civilization, construct magnificent structures, discover new technologies, and create a society capable of standing the test of time. Every settlement reflects the nature of the god it serves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/40f9227a45bc8d8a052ffd9da54da28e.avif?t=1780229283\" width=448 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/4d0c73ff6b95438b563102a724b4f31a.poster.avif?t=1780229283\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/4d0c73ff6b95438b563102a724b4f31a.webm?t=1780229283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/4d0c73ff6b95438b563102a724b4f31a.mp4?t=1780229283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When words and miracles are no longer enough, war begins. Lead armies into battle, defend your faithful, and conquer territories controlled by rival gods. Strategy, faith, and courage will determine whether your empire survives the conflicts to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964650/extras/a38a66e5b38235195ce20385620a0ed5.avif?t=1780229283\" width=448 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Begin your journey as a young god taking the first steps into a world filled with mystery. Discover ancient civilizations, uncover the secrets of forgotten powers, and face choices that will shape not only the fate of mortals, but the future of Eden itself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Good, evil, or a path somewhere in between? The story of the world is only just beginning.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A true